{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44898","headline":"冬中与诸公会宿姚端公宅怀永乐殷侍御 · 无可","name":"冬中与诸公会宿姚端公宅怀永乐殷侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柱史静开筵，所思何地偏。\n故人爲县吏，五老远峰前。\n宾榻寒侵树，公庭夜落泉。\n会当随假务，一就白云禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}